          "text": "I AM..."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "A Designer of Global Backgrounds"
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "I completed my master' at Parsons Design School and gained valuable work experience in New York and Taipei. Working with top designers shaped my high standards and distinctive design sensibilities."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Adaptive in Different Workplace"
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "From New York to Taipei, my career led me into all kinds of companies, from creative agencies to multinational corporates to start-ups. The different scales of these companies gave me perfect opportunities to learn different ways of working and how we bring our products to life."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Capable in Both Visual and UX"
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "I specialize in UI, interaction, and motion design for a wide range of products, such as mobile phones, wearables, websites, TVs, and Set-top boxes. My expertise spans from small-scale applications to large-scale operating systems and ecosystems."
        }
      ],
